The legal texts are official texts of the Republic of North Macedonia (the Constitution of 1991 and its
amendments), as published in Службен весник на Република Северна Македонија (slvesnik.com.mk, free issues)
and in the certified copy of the Assembly of the Republic of North Macedonia (sobranie.mk), retrieved
29 October 2026. Laws, other regulations and official acts are not protected by copyright under the Law on
Copyright and Related Rights (Закон за авторското право и сродните права).

Changes made by Lexifina: each amendment was applied by code to the provision its own instruction names;
each version was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph or alinea per line; spacing
and dashes were normalised and Latin look-alike letters inside Cyrillic words were made Cyrillic; and the
versions were arranged as git commits credited to the amendments that made each change. The wording of the
law was not changed. Neither the Official Gazette nor the Assembly endorses this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
